<title>USA: Maytag begins stock repurchase.</title>
<headline>Maytag begins stock repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTON, Iowa 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Maytag Corp said Thursday it has begun a program to repurchase up to an additional five million common shares.</p>
<p>In November, Maytag said it extended a share repurchase program with an additional authorization of five million shares.</p>
<p>The company said it completed its 10.8 million share repurchase program in 1996. That program was initiated in the fourth quarter of 1995.</p>
<p>At the end of 1996, Maytag had 97.6 million shares outstanding, compared with 104.7 million at the end of 1995.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
